    {
      "name": "dsh-voice-companion",
      "title": {
        "en": "Voice companion",
        "zh": "语音看板娘"
      },
      "description": {
        "zh": "语音看板娘 0.4：核心形象换成自研的 3D 发光体（core3d.js，单文件 WebGL，不依赖 three.js、不加载贴图）——idle / listening / thinking / speaking / error 五套状态调色板，87 个样式 token 全部可改；跟模型说一句「换成暖金色、切换慢一点」就能改主题，连同名字存成你自己的主题。面板收窄回两件事：语音输入（通话模式逐句朗读、输入框听写、按住热键说话）与派活给 DSH。音色按形象与每句话的情绪自适应，声音与语速可选。",
        "en": "Voice companion 0.4: the mascot is now an original 3D surface drawn by core3d.js — one WebGL file, no three.js, no textures — with five state palettes (idle, listening, thinking, speaking, error) and 87 style tokens open to edit. Ask the model in one sentence (\"make it warm gold, slower transitions\") and it rewrites the theme; name it and it is stored as your own. The panel is narrowed back to two jobs: voice input (call mode speaking replies sentence by sentence, composer dictation, hold-to-talk) and handing work to DSH. Voice and speed follow the character and each sentence mood."
      },
      "icon": "plugins/voice-companion/icon.svg",
      "author": "Feahter",
      "homepage": "https://github.com/Feahter/dsh-plugins/tree/main/plugins/voice-companion",
